  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* fix(tui): prevent Ctrl key and upper case rune key collision in keymaps by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/482\r\n\r\n### Others\r\n* [Automated] Update Nix Flake by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/474\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 12 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/476\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/stretchr/testify from 1.11.1 to 1.12.1 in /tuiexporter in the dependencies group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/477\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 8 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/480\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/481\r\n* [Automated] Update otel-tui/tuiexporter version by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/483\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/compare/v0.7.4...v0.7.5",
